c_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNLDs-RrTuPZECTJqCFPOv-6TeSF5Tetv7_Ye6Oq5MjeA&oe=6ADE214E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc2.png", "id": "1133487649502464", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624619_1133487652835797_438587995333255155_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QvzD8Rxw2d0Q7kNvwFlk8TE&_nc_oc=AdrSU7TAM-_MdsTh_iDuh1gRGX6MJvvQ7_UJa-VA5ljLzTOVLC-9olZy3Zd1DE4JtWQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPb1RHyGYul2_dKpkuW_iriPNk__tlG0seDWa4-qsOM8Q&oe=6ADE0B3E"}, "display_name": "DOSK - Retro PC Desk Simulator", "keywords": ["DOS", "PCEmulator", "Stereoscopic3D", "RetroGaming", "RetroPC"], "long_description": "**Your retro PC desk, brought to life in VR.**\n\nRun classic PC software on a virtual computer you can interact with. Pick up floppy disks, load CDs, and build your own retro setup in a nostalgic room.\n\n**Hands-on control**\n\n- Use a virtual keyboard and mouse, or connect a Bluetooth keyboard and mouse.\n- Press hardware buttons and swap disks with your controllers.\n- Customize controller mappings and save presets.\n\n**Build your retro setup**\n\nCreate virtual hard disks and load your own disk images. Adjust CPU, memory, graphics, and sound settings. Run DOS software or install compatible operating systems, including Windows 95 and 98, using your own installation media.\n\n**A new sense of depth**\n\nExperience supported Voodoo-accelerated games with experimental stereoscopic 3D. Adjust depth strength and convergence for a fresh perspective on familiar worlds.\n\n**Make it yours**\n\nChoose from two PC models and use a virtual room or passthrough. Load IMG/IMA floppy images and ISO/CUE/CHD CD images, or turn supported ZIP archives into virtual CDs.\n\nInterface languages: English, Korean, Japanese, German, French, and Spanish.\n\n**Getting started**\n\nDOSK STAR, an original demo game, is included to help you try disk insertion and software playback.\n\nOther games and operating system installation files are not included. Use legally obtained software and required licenses. Compatibility, performance, and stereoscopic 3D support vary by title and configuration.", "short_description": "Bring your retro PC desk to life in VR. Insert floppy disks and CDs, use a virtual or Bluetooth keyboard and mouse, and run your own DOS and compatible Windows software. Customize your retro setup and experience supported Voodoo games with adjustable stereoscopic 3D."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "963862396303719", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "DOSK - Retro PC Desk Simulator", "keywords": ["DOS", "EmuladorPC", "PCRetro", "3DEstereosc\u00f3pico", "JuegosRetro"], "long_description": "**Tu escritorio de PC retro cobra vida en RV.**\n\nEjecuta software cl\u00e1sico en un PC virtual interactivo. Inserta disquetes y CD y monta tu equipo retro en una habitaci\u00f3n nost\u00e1lgica.\n\n**Control directo**\n\n- Usa el teclado y el rat\u00f3n virtuales, o conecta un teclado y un rat\u00f3n Bluetooth.\n- Pulsa los botones del equipo y cambia discos con tus mandos.\n- Personaliza la asignaci\u00f3n de botones y guarda preajustes.\n\n**Tu propio PC retro**\n\nCrea discos duros virtuales y carga tus im\u00e1genes de disco. Ajusta CPU, memoria, gr\u00e1ficos y sonido. Ejecuta software de DOS o instala sistemas compatibles, como Windows 95 y 98, con tus propios medios de instalaci\u00f3n.\n\n**Una nueva profundidad**\n\nDescubre los juegos compatibles con aceleraci\u00f3n Voodoo en 3D estereosc\u00f3pico experimental. Ajusta la profundidad y la convergencia.\n\n**A tu gusto**\n\nElige entre dos modelos de PC y usa una habitaci\u00f3n virtual o passthrough. Carga im\u00e1genes de disquete IMG/IMA y de CD ISO/CUE/CHD, o usa archivos ZIP compatibles como CD virtuales.\n\nIdiomas de la interfaz: espa\u00f1ol, ingl\u00e9s, coreano, japon\u00e9s, alem\u00e1n y franc\u00e9s.\n\n**Para empezar**\n\nSe incluye el juego de demostraci\u00f3n propio DOSK STAR para probar la inserci\u00f3n de discos y la ejecuci\u00f3n de software.\n\nNo se incluyen otros juegos ni archivos de instalaci\u00f3n de sistemas operativos. Usa software obtenido legalmente y las licencias necesarias. La compatibilidad, el rendimiento y el soporte de 3D estereosc\u00f3pico var\u00edan seg\u00fan el software y la configuraci\u00f3n.", "short_description": "Revive tu escritorio de PC retro en RV. Inserta disquetes y CD, usa un teclado y un rat\u00f3n virtuales o Bluetooth y ejecuta tu propio software de DOS y Windows compatible. Personaliza tu equipo retro y disfruta de los juegos Voodoo compatibles con 3D estereosc\u00f3pico ajustable."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://horang.co.kr/dosk/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Studio HORANG", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://horang.co.kr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ko", "ja"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING", "TRACKED_KEYBOARD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "3138568442999001"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1136802032232953"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1136802032232953"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1792051920, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1136802032232953"}]}, "liveChannel": 